      "id": "6a9d943669f223072eb38364",
      "title": "Fri Oct 2nd Suffern Soccer Fundraiser 7pm",
      "fullUrl": "/tickets/p/fri-oct-2nd-suffern-soccer-fundraiser-7pm",
      "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Suffern Soccer Fundraiser</strong></p><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Get ready for a night of big laughs in support of the Suffern High School boys soccer team! Join us at Rhino Comedy in Suffern for an awesome standup comedy fundraiser headlined by the hilarious Laz Vic. Tickets are $35 and include pizza, water and the show, with additional food and drinks to order at Rhino\u2019s Hardware Bar.  Post-show Open Mic for brave souls!  </span></h4><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Come out to back the team, enjoy top-tier comedy, and have a fantastic night out with the Suffern soccer team\u2014grab your tickets now before seats fill up!</span></h4><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Doors open at 7pm  ~ Seating is a free for all ~ Hardware Bar menu </span><a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"/menu\"><span>HERE</span></a></h4><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">If you\u2019d like to make an additional donation - just click <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"/new-page-2\">HERE</a></h4><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Your name will be on our box office list, no need to print the email confirmation. The confirmation is sent to the email you provided at checkout and often appears in the \u201cspam\u201d folder.  </p></li></ul>",
