      "title": "Sat Oct 3rd Rhino Room Stand Up 8pm",
      "fullUrl": "/tickets/p/sat-oct-3rd-rhino-room-8pm",
      "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Rhino Room Stand Up</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Incredible night out featuring a hilarious line up of the best comedians anywhere. Table seating with 2 Item Minimum per person. Doors open at 7:30.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Hosted by Jackie Byrne</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Featuring Hannah Boone (<em>Rhino Comedy Favorite</em>), James King (<em>Broadway Comedy Club, Amazon Prime</em>) and Headliner Nick Tilleli (<em>Carolines Comedy Club</em>)</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Table seating with 2 item minimum per person. Doors open at 7:30.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">If purchasing separately please indicate the number in your party by writing to RhinoComedy@gmail.</p></li></ul><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Hardware Bar menu <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"/menu\"><strong><em><u><span>here</span></u></em></strong></a></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Your name will be on our box office list, no need to print the email confirmation. The confirmation is sent to the email you provided at checkout and often appears in the \u201cspam\u201d folder.  </p></li></ul>",
