      "id": "6aa2a7c36099b129b01b8503",
      "title": "Sat Oct 31st Halloween Costume Party (Suffern Bar Crawl)",
      "fullUrl": "/tickets/p/sat-oct-31st-halloween-costume-party-suffern-bar-crawl",
      "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Rhino Comedy welcomes all Suffern Bar Crawlers to our Halloween Costume Party!  We\u2019ll be showing some scary stuff on our big screen and awarding the title of Funniest Costume!</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">For Bar Crawlers registered with the Suffern Chamber of Commerce - the specials are:</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>$6 PREMIUM Mixed Drinks</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>$5 Hard Seltzers</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>$5 House Wine</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>$3.50 Domestics</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>$3 Halloween Shots of the Bars Choice</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>For everyone else - you pay the menu price!  </strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>If you\u2019d like to register for the Bar Crawl and support the Suffern Chamber you can do so soon on their website: </strong><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.suffernchamber.org/\"><strong><u>HE</u></strong></a><strong><u>RE</u></strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><strong>Rhino will award the winner of Funniest Costume a prize and bragging rights!</strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">(Our regular menu also available for delicious small plates check it out here at the <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"/menu\"><strong>HARDWARE BAR</strong></a>)</p>",
